Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Qiqi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time I grew big and small,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,today I went to a purple forest and met a cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that only had a smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi walked through the little door and came to a forest she had never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The trees were tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the leaves were purple,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and the flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,were singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But as she walked,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi noticed every tree looked the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She kept walking in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,circles. 'Am I lost?'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,a strange sound came from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi looked up — in the dark shadows of the trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,a glowing smile appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a smile, no body!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,two ears appeared next to the smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and then a purple cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It sat on the branch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,smiling at Qiqi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:00:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow~ Hello,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:00:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Cheshire Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.59,0:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been walking forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but every tree looks the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know which
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.31,0:01:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cheshire Cat didn't answer. Its smile grew bigger and bigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and then — its body disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the smile
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,remained on the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow~ Qiqi,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,if you don't know where you're
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,going, any road will do~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really don't know where to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi reached out to catch the smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.49,0:01:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but it slowly faded away too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.21,0:01:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She stood alone in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,forest, a little scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But then Qiqi remembered the Cheshire Cat's words. She took a deep breath, stopped,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and quietly looked around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden light shone through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the leaves onto her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a sign behind the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It says 'Tea Party →'!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is having a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi followed the sign and wasn't afraid anymore. In the distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,she could hear teacups clinking —
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,something fun was
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting for her ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that when you're lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the most important thing isn't to go fast — it's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,to stop first and look
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,around for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Little friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,if you ever get lost too,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,remember Qiqi's trick — stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,take a deep breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi will attend a tea party that never stops,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,with a Mad Hatter who never stops drinking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.30,0:02:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight!
